Package: mama
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18)
Recommends: fonts-telugu
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: MAMA CLI contributors <mama@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/OWNER/mama
Description: Telugu-speaking terminal buddy
 MAMA prints short, friendly, funny and motivational messages in Telugu and
 Telugu-English, the way a friend sitting next to you would say them.
 .
 Run "mama" for a random piece of wisdom, or pick a mood: motivate, calm,
 morning, night, code, git, roast, coffee or friday. It ships 176 original
 messages.
 .
 MAMA is a humour utility. It never executes commands, modifies files or git
 repositories, or makes network requests. A message may contain text such as
 a git command, but that text is only ever printed.
 .
 A UTF-8 locale and a font with Telugu glyphs are needed for readable output;
 the recommended fonts-telugu package provides one.
